#        identically. FIX: velocity_at(run, t, pos, ci) slices the IC
#        channel; interp_field asserts its unbatched contract.
#   [50] [G12] REDESIGNED SEAM-FREE: solid-body rotation is NOT a
#        periodic vector field (u = -Om*y has no periodic continuation),
#        so any origin placement puts a seam of wrong node values in the
#        test region. Rotation is now about the DOMAIN CENTER with
