#   [A] gamma=1 CONTROL (corrected): footprint comparison at MATCHED
#       thresholds on BOTH arms — the self-limiting drainage test.
#   [B] OCTAVE TRIAL: scale-structure on both arms.
# Single self-contained cell. CPU ~25-30 min (two dense-save evolutions).
# =============================================================================
# FIX LOG (V32c -> V32d):
#   [67] LaTeX leak: \pi instead of np.pi in ic_tubes return line ->
#        SyntaxError at import/parse time. Fixed.
#   [68] zg unused in gate block (leftover) — removed.
#   [69] figure legend note: explicit CL/TR style key added.
# All V32c design corrections carry: [G16] M0 consistency gate; both
