#        footprint saturation.
#   [Q2] MATCHED-nu FOOTPRINT: is self-limiting drainage-equivalent?
#   [Q3] GPU OCTAVE TRIAL (64^3, SCALE-CONSISTENT routing — the dx-flaw
#        fix): octave shares at two resolutions; cross-resolution
#        convergence. AUTO: platform-attribute detection ([75]).
# Single self-contained cell. GPU ~30-40 min; CPU-only ~18-25 min.
